	<https://linked.archi/examples/vio/concepts#target> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Target = the Target plateau (arch:Target): the landscape the migration aims at, not one system. The successor of a legacy system is one application in it (ADR-0007: the Booking Orchestrator). The example computes a gap to target by excluding alternative providers marked PhaseOut or Baseline; missing state remains eligible. This is not explicit plateau membership."@en ;
		<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "target landscape"@en , "to-be"@en , "target state"@en ;
		<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "target"@en ;
